<title>GERMANY: Trinkaus says 96 net profit up 25 pct.</title>
<headline>Trinkaus says 96 net profit up 25 pct.</headline>
<dateline>DUESSELDORF, Germany 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calendar 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Group net profit			    75.5   vs 60.4</p>
<p>    Group operating profit		    150.8  vs 125.3</p>
<p>    Group risk provisions		     26.3   vs 29.8</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German bank is Trinkaus &amp; Burkhardt. The bank is a subsidiary of Britain's Midland Bank, which in turn is a unit of HSBC Holdings Plc.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
